<title>NORWAY: Norway's Dec PPI rose 2.6 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Norway's Dec PPI rose 2.6 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the</p>
<p>following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     DEC 1996   NOV 1996  DEC 1995</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +0.1	 -0.6	+0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +2.6	 +2.8	+1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    160.6	160.5     156.5</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
